---
import FlowDiagram from "../FlowDiagram.astro";
---

<section class="container flow-section">
  <div class="flow-intro">
    <span class="eyebrow">Pipeline</span>
    <h2 id="flow-title">计算流程</h2>
    <p>源码先展开为 λ 表达式，然后编译成 SKI 组合子，最后归约得到结果。</p>
  </div>
  <FlowDiagram />
</section>

<style>
.flow-section {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1fr) minmax(0, 340px);
  align-items: center;
  gap: 64px;
}
.flow-intro h2 {
  font-size: 34px;
  margin: 8px 0 0;
}
.flow-intro p {
  color: var(--muted-text);
  max-width: 440px;
  line-height: 1.7;
  margin: 16px 0 0;
}
@media (max-width: 700px) {
  .flow-section {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    gap: 36px;
  }
}
</style>
